# Rust_Julia_FFI_Flutter_Template

FlutterùRustùJulia FFI template (wrdlHelper reference). **iOS-first**; macOS/Android exist. Manual agentic sync ù no upstream merge (protects FFI files).

**Read first:** [docs/SETUP_GUIDE.md](../../docs/SETUP_GUIDE.md) before touching `ios/`, `rust/Cargo.toml`, `flutter_rust_bridge.yaml`, or `rust_builder/`.

**Tracked truth:** PM_PLAN.md, AGENT_HANDOFF.md, TEST_PLAN.md, docs/PROJECT_STATUS.md.

## Project invariants (this template)

- FFI bindings are fragile. Never edit `wrdlHelper/lib/src/rust/` (generated). After Rust API changes: `flutter_rust_bridge_codegen generate`.
- Merge-ready: `cd wrdlHelper && flutter test && cd rust && cargo test && cd ..`
- Do not stack a Dart-only story on a red `cargo test`.

## Hard rules (one file each ù do not recopy)

| Failure mode | Rule |
|--------------|------|
| Next story while current is uncommitted | `one-story-one-ship.mdc` + `ffi-smoke-pause.mdc` |
| Cursor commit/PR attribution | `no-cursor-commit-attribution.mdc` |
| Tiers, evidence, harvest | `testing.mdc` + `TEST_TDD.md` |
| Handoff / epic close | `handoff-checklist.mdc`, `epic-close.mdc` |
| Gemini drop | `gemini-handoff.mdc` |
| Branch / commit / push | `github-feature-workflow` + AGENT_HANDOFF |
